flowchart TB
  Start((Start)) --> Browse[Browse catalogue and enrol]
  Browse --> Paid{Payment verified?}
  Paid -- No --> PaymentFail[Show failure or retry; no access]
  Paid -- Yes --> Access{Access authorised?}
  Access -- No --> Denied[Show access message]
  Access -- Yes --> Video{Video available?}
  Video -- No --> Retry[Show playback error and retry]
  Retry --> Video
  Video -- Yes --> Watch[Watch required lesson]
  Watch --> Progress[Record lesson completion]
  Progress --> Complete{All required lessons complete?}
  Complete -- No --> Access
  Complete -- Yes --> Quiz[Submit quiz]
  Quiz --> Passed{Score meets configured threshold?}
  Passed -- No --> Retake[Follow approved retake policy]
  Passed -- Yes --> Eligible[Check paid enrolment, 100% completion, quiz pass]
  Eligible --> Issue[Issue or return unique certificate]
  Issue --> End((Certificate available))
  PaymentFail --> Stop((End / retry later))
  Denied --> Stop
  Retake --> Stop
